        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSF800, Solid Brass 8\" Floor Mounted Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith an 8 Inch height, this floor mounted very tall door stop is great for use on doors that open up to a step down such as patio and porch doors. The 8 Inch floor mounted door stops are available in oil rubbed bronze,  satin nickel, polished brass or polished chrome finishes. The package includes fasteners for wood or concrete installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSF800-specifications.gif?v=1704354594\" width\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSF800 8 Inch Floor Mount Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-floor-mounted-door-stop-with-hook-deltana-dsf830\"><b>Deltana DSF830 8 Inch Door Stop with Catch</b></a>\r\nand <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSF800 8 Inch Tall Door Stop:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Center Line: 7-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection of the Rubber Bumper: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSF800.pdf?v=1704262350\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSF800 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
